# Normalize line endings to LF inside the repository.
#
# Without this, saving any file from a Windows editor rewrites every line as
# CRLF. Git then reports the whole file as changed: a one-line edit arrives in
# review as a full-file rewrite, which buries the real change and makes the
# history unreadable. Checkouts still honour each developer's platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
